is.\">functionalStatusEHDSCondition</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSCondition.html\">EHDSCondition</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDischargeReport.body.admissionEvaluation.functionalStatus[x].</span><span title=\"EHDSObservation means a structured set of data elements describing a clinical finding or measurement and its results. This includes simple observational findings (e.g., alcohol and tobacco use, blood pressure measurements) and complex medical test results (e.g., cardiopulmonary stress test, Holter monitor), supporting the grouping of related observations and the representation of multi-part results observed under shared or different conditions.\">functionalStatusEHDSObservation</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSObservation.html\">EHDSObservation</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDischargeReport.body.admissionEvaluation.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDischargeReport-definitions.html#EHDSDischargeReport.body.admissionEvaluation.note\" title=\"Free text notes by the evaluation performer.\">note</a><a name=\"EHDSDischargeReport.body.admissionEvaluation.note\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Free text notes by the evaluation performer.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck111.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDischargeReport.body.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDischargeReport-definitions.html#EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory\" title=\"Section: Patient health history (anamnesis) containing only information that is highly relevant to this specific episode of care. The model is designed with the expectation that the patient summary is available.\">patientHistory</a><a name=\"EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Base</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Section: Patient health history (anamnesis) containing only information that is highly relevant to this specific episode of care. The model is designed with the expectation that the patient summary is available.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDischargeReport-definitions.html#EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.generatedNarrative\" title=\"Narrative, potentially formatted, content of the whole section. If the section includes structured information, it shall also be included in generatedNarrative.\">generatedNarrative</a><a name=\"EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.generatedNarrative\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/narrative.html#Narrative\">Narrative</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Narrative, potentially formatted, content of the whole section. If the section includes structured information, it shall also be included in generatedNarrative.<br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">This profile does not constrain the narrative in regard to content, language, or traceability to data elements</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1111.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_choice.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Choice of Types\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDischargeReport-definitions.html#EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.pastProblems[x]\" title=\"A list of conditions that a patient suffered from in the past or still suffers from. Unlike the diagnostic summary, the medical history is not only a list of problems but may also contain a broader description of the condition and its progress, details about treatment, including medication and patient response to treatment. The past problem section (unlike the same section of the patient summary) shall include only conditions that are important for continuity of care. This section, if provided, complements the diagnostic summary section of the discharge report.\">pastProblems[x]</a><a name=\"EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.pastProblems_x_\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">A list of conditions that a patient suffered from in the past or still suffers from. Unlike the diagnostic summary, the medical history is not only a list of problems but may also contain a broader description of the condition and its progress, details about treatment, including medication and patient response to treatment. The past problem section (unlike the same section of the patient summary) shall include only conditions that are important for continuity of care. This section, if provided, complements the diagnostic summary section of the discharge report.<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.pastProblems[x].</span><span title=\"EHDSCondition means a structured set of data elements describing a clinical condition, problem, or diagnosis.\">pastProblemsEHDSCondition</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSCondition.html\">EHDSCondition</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck11100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; b