.body.patientHistory.devicesAndImplants\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDeviceUse.html\">EHDSDeviceUse</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Devices and implants in patient anamnesis.<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_resource.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Resource\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSDischargeReport-definitions.html#EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.procedures\" title=\"Procedures in patient anamnesis.\">procedures</a><a name=\"EHDSDischargeReport.body.patientHistory.procedures\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSProcedure.html\">EHDSProcedure</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Procedures in patient anamnesis.<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNo